,"text":"親指と人差し指を擦るのが癖\n緊張したときとかにするのかなぁ？ってまあやは発見した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしたこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋でまいやんの隣に座って話してたんだけど、わざと声大きくして話してきたりするとても変わってる人だと思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつも人を笑わせてる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！関係ないけどまいやんまあやの絵めっちゃ誉めてくれるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとひなちまでまいやんの脚を押して痛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなるまで柔軟しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pr